PSDesiredStateConfiguration -	Core module	Provides the DSC engine and commands
Get-DscResource	- Cmdlet Discovers DSC resources
Invoke-DscResource	- Cmdlet Executes DSC resources
GPRegistryPolicyDsc	- Resource module	Provides Group Policy management resources
RegistryPolicyFile	- DSC resource	Reads and modifies Registry.pol
RefreshRegistryPolicy	- DSC resource	Refreshes Group Policy



